  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 102.02 Local Authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 102.02 Local Authority. Nothing in this chapter shall diminish any authority of a municipality to adopt or enforce any rules or ordinances respecting drinking water or public water systems, but no such rule or ordinances shall relieve any person of any requirements otherwise applicable under this chapter.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
